I am in my flat now.
I look at my mobile.
Every day, I check the calendar.
This is the month of February.
I look at the plan for Saturday.
On Saturday morning at eleven o'clock, I am drinking coffee with Asha.
But there is a problem here.
Sometimes I forget things.
My haircut is also on Saturday.
At what time is the haircut?
That is also at exactly eleven o'clock in the morning!
Oh no!
Both tasks are at the same time.
Coffee with Asha is at eleven o'clock.
The haircut is also at eleven o'clock.
I always do only one thing at a time.
So at eleven o'clock, I am very busy.
What do I do now?
I make a phone call to the salon.
I change the time for the haircut.
